{
  "version": "v1.1.0",
  "date": "2026-10-25",
  "release_url": "https://github.com/SadPull/LLM-benders-SUC/releases/tag/v1.1.0",
  "changes": [
    "validation.reachable_capacity: per-unit, per-hour reachable output bound (forward start-up ramp chain from initial_output, backward shutdown chain); reachable_shortfall is built on it",
    "repair() takes the larger of the scenario capacity deficit and the reachable-output deficit; WholeDay.prepare() skips schedules with a remaining shortfall as reachable_infeasible",
    "BlockSearch.build_qubo extracted without behaviour change so QUBO sizes can be recorded",
    "Paper experiment code: offline_pilot.py (sandboxed frozen LLM-written program L3, arms A and L+SA), offline_worker.py, programs/L3.py, paper_pilot.py, paper_figures.py, run_paper_pilot.py",
    "L3 receives probability-weighted load and dispatch on multi-scenario instances; candidates are still checked on every scenario and dispatched exactly over the full day",
    "New instance instances/ieee118s10 (54 units x 24 h x 10 scenarios) generated reproducibly by make_ieee118_scenarios.py (seed 20261025, --check mode)"
  ],
  "findings": {
    "ieee118s10": "L+SA final gap 0.196-0.633% vs A 2.881% on all 5 seeds; median AUC reduction 70.8%; pre-registered criterion M1 passed",
    "rts24": "L+SA final gap 0.531-3.321% vs A 5.475% on all 5 seeds; median AUC reduction 39.8%; pre-registered criterion M2 passed",
    "time_to_baseline": "L+SA reached the cost A ended with after 600 s within about 10 s on ieee118s10 and about 1 s on rts24",
    "online_llm_calls": 0,
    "qubo_bits": "Final block QUBOs had 1,413-2,490 variables; encoding the same stored cuts the standard way (theta expansion plus one slack register per cut) needs at least 2,537-14,143; the scenario count does not enter the QUBO because scenarios are aggregated into one cut",
    "case": "From the A end schedule (ieee118s10, seed 17), the third L3 call switched G5 off in hours 1-6 where the probability-weighted marginal price was about 21-24 $/MWh; full-day cost -21,631.06 (-0.580%)",
    "audit": "Criteria recomputed, best two runs per instance re-dispatched and independently validated, instance and reference hashes matched",
    "consolidation": "Code consolidated after the runs; fixed-round trials of old and new code matched exactly (see CONSOLIDATION.md in the compare directory)"
  },
